<section id="fundamental-conjectures" class="focus-intro wrap reveal" aria-labelledby="focus-intro-title">
  <div class="focus-intro-index">03</div>
  <div>
    <p class="kicker">The public argument</p>
    <h2 id="focus-intro-title">Three conjectures carry the framework</h2>
  </div>
  <p class="lede muted">Each conjecture now carries its complete research Part beneath it: First Principles develops integration, Cosmic Architecture develops the splice, and Seams and Return develops the topology of return. Read them in that sequence, or open any coded study directly.</p>
